{"seq":22,"slug":"product-led-growth","title":"产品驱动增长","stage":"DONE","category":"ecommerce","chapterCount":4,"docCount":12,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/ecommerce/product-led-growth","rating":{"composite":4.06,"verdict":"stable","groups":{"quality":3.8,"coverage":3.75,"positioning":4.5,"strategic":4.33},"weights":{"quality":0.3,"coverage":0.25,"positioning":0.2,"strategic":0.25},"profile":null},"introHtml":"<h1 id=\"产品驱动增长-plg\">产品驱动增长（PLG）</h1><p>产品驱动增长是一种以产品体验本身作为获客、激活、留存和扩展核心引擎的增长模式。与传统销售驱动增长（SLG）依赖人工销售团队不同，PLG 让用户在接触销售之前就能自主注册、体验核心价值并完成付费转化。2026 年，全球 58% 的 B2B SaaS 企业已采用某种形式的 PLG 动作，Cursor 在未雇佣企业销售前达到 $200M ARR 的案例证明了这一模式的爆发力。</p>\n<p>本 hub 聚焦于 PLG 的完整运营体系——从底层模型到具体执行策略。与兄弟 hub 的分工边界如下：「电商用户增长」hub 覆盖广义增长方法论（付费获客、有机增长、留存分析等），适用于所有电商形态；本 hub 则专注于以产品为中心的增长飞轮，面向构建自助式 SaaS/工具产品的团队。「电商数据分析」hub 提供度量基础设施（漏斗分析、用户行为分析、cohort 分析等），本 hub 会在指标体系和 PQL 评分等章节引用其方法论，但不重复数据工程细节。</p>\n<p>推荐学习路径因读者背景而异：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>产品经理/增长负责人</strong>：基础篇全读 → 激活篇 → 运营篇（重点定价与扩展） → 获客篇补充</li>\n<li><strong>工程师/技术负责人</strong>：基础篇第 1-2 篇 → 获客篇（漏斗实现） → 激活篇（Onboarding 技术栈与 PQL 引擎） → 运营篇</li>\n<li><strong>创始人/CEO</strong>：基础篇第 3 篇（指标体系）→ 运营篇全读 → 其余按需</li>\n</ul>\n<p>前置知识：理解基本的 SaaS 商业模型（订阅制、ARR/MRR 概念）、漏斗分析基础。无需编程经验，但激活篇和获客篇中的部分实现细节假设读者具备基本的产品/技术理解力。</p>\n","chapters":[{"seq":1,"slug":"foundations","title":"基础篇导读","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/ecommerce/product-led-growth/foundations","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"plg-core-model","title":"PLG 核心模型与演进","url":"/l-doc-books/h/ecommerce/product-led-growth/foundations/plg-core-model"},{"seq":2,"slug":"plg-vs-slg-hybrid","title":"PLG 与 SLG 对比及混合模式","url":"/l-doc-books/h/ecommerce/product-led-growth/foundations/plg-vs-slg-hybrid"},{"seq":3,"slug":"plg-metrics-framework","title":"PLG 核心指标体系","url":"/l-doc-books/h/ecommerce/product-led-growth/foundations/plg-metrics-framework"}]},{"seq":2,"slug":"acquisition","title":"获客篇导读","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/ecommerce/product-led-growth/acquisition","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"self-serve-funnel","title":"自助获客漏斗设计","url":"/l-doc-books/h/ecommerce/product-led-growth/acquisition/self-serve-funnel"},{"seq":2,"slug":"freemium-trial-strategy","title":"Freemium 与免费试用策略","url":"/l-doc-books/h/ecommerce/product-led-growth/acquisition/freemium-trial-strategy"},{"seq":3,"slug":"viral-loop-community","title":"病毒循环与社区驱动增长","url":"/l-doc-books/h/ecommerce/product-led-growth/acquisition/viral-loop-community"}]},{"seq":3,"slug":"activation","title":"激活篇导读","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/ecommerce/product-led-growth/activation","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"time-to-value","title":"Time-to-Value 与 Aha Moment 设计","url":"/l-doc-books/h/ecommerce/product-led-growth/activation/time-to-value"},{"seq":2,"slug":"product-onboarding","title":"产品化引导系统","url":"/l-doc-books/h/ecommerce/product-led-growth/activation/product-onboarding"},{"seq":3,"slug":"pql-scoring","title":"PQL 评分与转化引擎","url":"/l-doc-books/h/ecommerce/product-led-growth/activation/pql-scoring"}]},{"seq":4,"slug":"operations","title":"运营篇导读","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/ecommerce/product-led-growth/operations","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"usage-based-pricing","title":"用量计费与定价策略","url":"/l-doc-books/h/ecommerce/product-led-growth/operations/usage-based-pricing"},{"seq":2,"slug":"expansion-revenue","title":"扩展收入与 NRR 飞轮","url":"/l-doc-books/h/ecommerce/product-led-growth/operations/expansion-revenue"},{"seq":3,"slug":"plg-sales-handoff","title":"PLG 到 Sales 的交接机制","url":"/l-doc-books/h/ecommerce/product-led-growth/operations/plg-sales-handoff"}]}]}